-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data — NOT covered by the MIT license above
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers the PIPELINE CODE AND DOCUMENTATION only. Datasets that the
pipeline downloads or that you supply are governed by their own terms:

  * FINN (Fire INventory from NCAR) emissions — NSF NCAR / UCAR ACOM; obtained
    from the NSF NCAR Research Data Archive (ds312.9). Cite Wiedinmyer et al.
    (2011, 2023) and acknowledge the archive per UCAR's terms.
  * IBGE Malha Municipal (municipality boundaries) — Instituto Brasileiro de
    Geografia e Estatística; used under IBGE's terms of use.
  * MODIS / VIIRS active-fire products — NASA FIRMS / LP DAAC terms.
  * MapBiomas (Fogo Collection 4; land use and land cover, Collections 10 and 10.1)
    — MapBiomas terms of use; cite the collection used.
  * ERA5-Land monthly reanalysis — ECMWF / Copernicus Climate Change Service terms.
  * Oceanic Niño Index (ONI) — NOAA Climate Prediction Center.

The repository ships files derived from these datasets (data/derived/, data/inputs/,
data/external/) only to make the published results reproducible.

Retain the appropriate citations and data-use acknowledgements when you publish.
